  "observations": [
    "Strong retention is the approved Stage 1 substitute; weak behavior is owed in Stage 2.",
    "Counts describe the pinned native image; re-census the actual port heap. Fixed-capacity EQ tables refuse past capacity or the 16384 ceiling; growth, EQL/EQUAL and actual root installation remain required.",
    "Use the corrected empty-state entries: cancellation, lookup and draining return one NIL, registration refuses. Image slots, scheduling disablement and real CCL bindings must join before READY.",
    "The entries file is reviewed compiler input data (including qualification helpers), not an automatically loaded native source file. Only the five modules named by bindings.json are installed artifacts.",
    "No LL15 credit: acceptance of these components does not establish initializer membership or completion."
  ],
